          "title": "You'll want to know: o engarrafamento",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o engarrafamento — \"the traffic jam\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ficámos uma hora no engarrafamento. We were stuck in the traffic jam for an hour."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally a 'bottling'. In Brazil also o congestionamento."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "engarrafamento is built on engarrafar 'to bottle, to put in a bottle' with -mento (EtymDB): traffic squeezed as if through a bottleneck."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
